==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be made a lot easier with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Farm the first Doge Dark with an [[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|Money Up unit]] for cash, and then deploy Bahamut to kill the Rain D., then have him hit the base with slight support (e.g. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]). When you do, you can use a combination of A. Bahamut's high damage and a freeze on Kurosawah, allowing Bahamut to kill him, leaving you with a stage that can be cleaned up with the help of units like Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Divided Light's Japanese name, Nanairo ni Wakatareru Hikari (七色に分かたれる光, "Light Divided into Seven Colors"), references [[wikipedia:Isaac Newton|Isaac Newton]]'s contributions to [[wikipedia:Optics|optics]], in particular his famous experiment determining that a prism disperses white light into its constituent colors.
**Newton's theory of color superseded [[wikipedia:Aristotle|Aristotle]]'s theory that all colors are a mix of black and white, and Divided Light only contains [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and white enemies.

